<title>USA: Pinkerton's sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Pinkerton's sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>ENCINO, Calif. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pinkerton's Inc said Thursday it set a three-for-two stock split, payable August 27 to shareholders of record August 7.</p>
</text>
